# The plain answers (Docs/Design/84 §7.2, defect 13): a line that hands on to one of these concepts could, before Phase 2,
# find nothing to answer it when the answerer's facts matched none of the written replies, and the talk ended there. The
# dead-end proof now refuses a library where that can happen. These hold for anyone, know nothing, and speak only when
# nothing better holds (priority -1). Each is true wherever its concept is reached, whoever says it.

rule fb_crime_answer
when concept=crime.answer
does react.news
priority -1
say That's a bad business. | Bright One. What's the town coming to? | Hard to hear. Hard to know what to say.

rule fb_dreams_answer
when concept=dreams.answer
does answer.detail
priority -1
say I've never let myself think about it. | Ask me another day. I'd only say something foolish. | Enough to get by, and a bit over.

rule fb_event_answer
when concept=event.answer
does react.news
priority -1
say So I'd heard. | Is that so? Folk talk of little else. | We'll see what comes of it.

rule fb_event_close
when concept=event.close
does reassure
priority -1
say It'll pass. Most things do. | Aye. Well. We go on.

rule fb_faith_answer
when concept=faith.answer
does answer.detail
priority -1
say Now and then. I'll leave it there. | That's between me and the Bright One. | Ask me on a better day.

rule fb_friend_parting
when concept=friend.parting
does farewell.return
priority -1
say Go on, then. Mind how you go. | Another time, then. | Off you go.

rule fb_friend_tease
when concept=friend.tease
does tease.return
priority -1
say Charming. Lovely to see you too. | Ha. And a good day to you as well. | Keep it up and see where it gets you.

rule fb_harvest_answer
when concept=harvest.answer
does react.news
priority -1
say So I hear. The farms would know best. | We'll see what it does to the price of bread. | Let's hope it holds.

rule fb_moment_reply_home
when concept=moment.reply_home
does answer.detail
priority -1
say From where I grew up, same as anyone's. | Home. Where else would it be from? | It's the only voice I've got.

rule fb_reply_close
when concept=reply.close
does ack
priority -1
say Well. There it is. | #bc_fair_enough# | Aye, well.

rule fb_season_answer
when concept=season.answer
does answer.detail
priority -1
say Every season has its work. | It comes round whether we're ready or not. | It'll turn again soon enough.

rule fb_ships_answer
when concept=ships.answer
does react.news
priority -1
say The sea does as it likes. | I leave the ships to the Wharf folk. | The Wharf will know more than I do.

rule fb_street_answer
when concept=street.answer
does react.news
priority -1
say Hard times for some. | I see them. I don't always know what to do. | Bright One keep them.

rule fb_times_answer
when concept=times.answer
does react.complaint
priority -1
say It's hard all round. | We all feel it, one way or another. | It'll turn. It always turns, in the end.

rule fb_times_close
when concept=times.close
does apologise
priority -1
say No offence meant. | I spoke out of turn. Let it go.

rule fb_travel_from
when concept=travel.from
does answer.detail
priority -1
say You'd not know the place. | That's a long story, and I've not the time for it. | Where I grew up, and that's all I'll say.

rule fb_travel_home
when concept=travel.home
does answer.detail
priority -1
say It's home. That's all I can tell you. | Better than they say, and worse. | Some days I miss it. Most days I don't think of it.

rule fb_work_reply
when concept=work.reply
does react.self
priority -1
say That's work for you. | Well. It keeps the roof on. | Better than none.
